        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Set in a mystical world where mortal and fairy realms collide, the game tells the story of a mortal woman named Faye who is the only being able to awaken from a powerful fairy's dream spell. She embarks on an adventure through a dream world to find her fairy husband and save her hometown. To solve the mystery, players must complete puzzles and search for clues leading to the whereabouts of Faye's husband.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Ambientado en un mundo místico donde los reinos mortal y de las hadas chocan, el juego narra la historia de Faye, una mujer mortal que es la única capaz de despertar del poderoso hechizo de sueño de un hada. Emprende una aventura por un mundo onírico para encontrar a su esposo hada y salvar su pueblo natal. Para resolver el misterio, los jugadores deben completar rompecabezas y buscar pistas que conduzcan al paradero del esposo de Faye.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2007",
          "source": "igdb",
